NOT APPLIED. The CEO owns settings.json. To enable the director nudge, merge
the "PreToolUse" array below into the "hooks" object of the chosen settings.json
(~/.claude/settings.json for all projects, or the project's .claude/settings.json
for QL-G3-Enterprise only). If a PreToolUse array already exists, append this
one matcher object to it rather than replacing the array.

{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|PowerShell",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash C:/dev/claude-skills-suite/hooks/director-nudge.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}

To disable: remove that matcher object again. To reset a session's counter,
delete its file under $TMPDIR/claude-director-nudge/.
